SUMMARY:Celebrate the Moon Festival in the Valley
DESCRIPTION:One of the most auspicious dates on the Asian calendars\, the M
 oon Festival (or Mid-Autumn Festival)\, occurs on the date when the moon i
 s at its fullest. Gather your friends and family for one of the most vibra
 nt cultural events of the year. On Saturday 26 September\, Fortitude Valle
 y will come alive with colour\, music and tradition as the Moon Festival r
 eturns. From spectacular lion and dragon dances to lantern making workshop
 s and interactive performances\, the Valley is the place to be for an even
 ing of free entertainment\, food and festivity. Savour authentic Asian din
 ing at your favourite Valley restaurant and soak up the community spirit t
 hat makes this celebration unforgettable. Visit the My Valley website for 
 more information.
LOCATION:Chinatown Mall\, Fortitude Valley\, Chinatown Mall\, Duncan St\, F
 ortitude Valley
URL:https://myvalley.com.au/moon-festival
END:VEVENT
